	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 9th level, your reputation allows you to press lesser ne’er-do-wells to your needs. Once a week, when in a settlement where your reputation is known, you may make an Intimidation check against a DC of 10 plus double the tier of the region where the settlement lies. On a success, you may call in a favor available to someone of your Prestige rating minus 1 without expending any favors owed to you.</p>",
